<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00595">
	<title>Resuming Manual Speed Limit Assist</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02207">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02208">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25E049_3.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To resume Manual Speed Limit Assist after the function was paused, operate the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>), (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>), (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch.</p>
		<p>If you push the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch up or (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch down, vehicle speed will be set to the current speed on the cluster.</p>
		<p>If you press the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch, vehicle speed will resume to the preset speed.</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>